en-US.releaseNotes:
1. Brand-new UI: desktop left-side navigation, pinnable quick toolbar with a traffic control page, redesigned dark mode and SVG icons; mobile navigation pages and toolbox revamped as well;
2. Support importing mTLS client certificates (#680);
3. Added replay task management to save and replay requests in batches;
4. Capture MQTT over TLS traffic, displayed as a packet stream with originating app attribution (#949);
5. Form-based editing for form-data and form-urlencoded bodies; selected text can be sent directly to the Decoder or AES tools;
6. Enhanced copy-as-Python-requests and curl import parsing;
7. Fixed display of compressed and non-standard SSE bodies, close-delimited response body handling (#956), app filter loading failures, and other issues; minimum iOS version raised to iOS 15.
